<name><surname>Montestrucq</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Parslow</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Richardson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Sadetzki</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Salminen</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Schuz</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Tynes</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Woodward</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><collab>Interphone Study Group</collab></person-group><article-title>Validation of short term recall of mobile phone use for the Interphone study</article-title><source>Occup Environ Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>63</volume><supplement>4</supplement><fpage>237</fpage><lpage>243</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Occup Environ Med||63|237||bib5|'--></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>